{"seq":1,"slug":"compound-components","title":"复合组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/compound-components","wordCount":540,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"复合组件\">复合组件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复合组件（Compound Components）是一组协同工作、共享隐式状态的组件：父组件持有状态，子组件通过 Context 读取它，使用者用组合子组件的方式拼出界面，HTML 的 <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> + <code>&lt;option&gt;</code> 就是典型例子。相比用 props 配置一次性渲染，它支持自定义布局与条件渲染。本章讲解基础实现、Accordion 模式、灵活的 API 设计，以及如何同时支持受控与非受控用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是复合组件\">什么是复合组件</h2><p><strong>复合组件（Compound Components）</strong> 是一种将相关组件组合在一起，共享隐式状态的设计模式。父组件管理状态，子组件通过 Context 访问状态，使用者通过组合子组件来构建灵活的 UI。HTML 中的 <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> + <code>&lt;option&gt;</code> 就是典型的复合组件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Tabs (管理状态)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;TabList&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;TabPanels&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Tab (通过 Context 读取状态)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Tab&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;Tab&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;TabPanel&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;TabPanel&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;TabPanel&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Tabs (管理状态)\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"TabList\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"TabPanels\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Tab (通过 Context 读取状态)\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Tab\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"Tab\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"TabPanel\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"TabPanel\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"TabPanel\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础实现-tabs-组件\">基础实现：Tabs 组件</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface TabsContextValue {&#10;  activeIndex: number;&#10;  setActiveIndex: (index: number) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const TabsContext = createContext&lt;TabsContextValue | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;function useTabsContext(): TabsContextValue {&#10;  const context = useContext(TabsContext);&#10;  if (!context) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;Tabs 子组件必须在 &lt;Tabs&gt; 内使用&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return context;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Tabs({ defaultIndex = 0, children }: { defaultIndex?: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(defaultIndex);&#10;&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ activeIndex, setActiveIndex }), [activeIndex]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;TabsContext.Provider value={value}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div role=&quot;tablist&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/TabsContext.Provider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Tab({ index, children }: { index: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const { activeIndex, setActiveIndex } = useTabsContext();&#10;  const isActive = activeIndex === index;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;button role=&quot;tab&quot; aria-selected={isActive} onClick={() =&gt; setActiveIndex(index)}&gt;&#10;      {children}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function TabPanel({ index, children }: { index: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const { activeIndex } = useTabsContext();&#10;&#10;  if (activeIndex !== index) return null;&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div role=&quot;tabpanel&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;Tabs.Tab = Tab;&#10;Tabs.TabPanel = TabPanel;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface TabsContextValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  activeIndex: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setActiveIndex: (index: number) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const TabsContext = createContext&#x3C;TabsContextValue | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function useTabsContext(): TabsContextValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const context = useContext(TabsContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    throw new Error('Tabs 子组件必须在 &#x3C;Tabs> 内使用');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return context;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Tabs({ defaultIndex = 0, children }: { defaultIndex?: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(defaultIndex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ activeIndex, setActiveIndex }), [activeIndex]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;TabsContext.Provider value={value}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div role=\"tablist\">{children}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/TabsContext.Provider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Tab({ index, children }: { index: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { activeIndex, setActiveIndex } = useTabsContext();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isActive = activeIndex === index;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button role=\"tab\" aria-selected={isActive} onClick={() => setActiveIndex(index)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {children}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TabPanel({ index, children }: { index: number; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { activeIndex } = useTabsContext();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (activeIndex !== index) return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div role=\"tabpanel\">{children}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tabs.Tab = Tab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tabs.TabPanel = TabPanel;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用方式\">使用方式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Tabs defaultIndex={0}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;&#10;        &lt;Tabs.Tab index={0}&gt;基础&lt;/Tabs.Tab&gt;&#10;        &lt;Tabs.Tab index={1}&gt;高级&lt;/Tabs.Tab&gt;&#10;        &lt;Tabs.Tab index={2}&gt;设置&lt;/Tabs.Tab&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Tabs.TabPanel index={0}&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;基础内容&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Tabs.TabPanel&gt;&#10;      &lt;Tabs.TabPanel index={1}&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;高级内容&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Tabs.TabPanel&gt;&#10;      &lt;Tabs.TabPanel index={2}&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;设置内容&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Tabs.TabPanel&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Tabs&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Tabs defaultIndex={0}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Tabs.Tab index={0}>基础&#x3C;/Tabs.Tab></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Tabs.Tab index={1}>高级&#x3C;/Tabs.Tab></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Tabs.Tab index={2}>设置&#x3C;/Tabs.Tab></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Tabs.TabPanel index={0}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>基础内容&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Tabs.TabPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Tabs.TabPanel index={1}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>高级内容&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Tabs.TabPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Tabs.TabPanel index={2}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>设置内容&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Tabs.TabPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Tabs></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"accordion-模式\">Accordion 模式</h2><p>复合组件非常适合构建 Accordion（手风琴）组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface AccordionContextValue {&#10;  openItems: Set&lt;string&gt;;&#10;  toggle: (id: string) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const AccordionContext = createContext&lt;AccordionContextValue | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;function Accordion({ multiple = false, children }: { multiple?: boolean; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [openItems, setOpenItems] = useState&lt;Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;(new Set());&#10;&#10;  const toggle = useCallback(&#10;    (id: string) =&gt; {&#10;      setOpenItems((prev) =&gt; {&#10;        const next = new Set(multiple ? prev : []);&#10;        if (next.has(id)) {&#10;          next.delete(id);&#10;        } else {&#10;          next.add(id);&#10;        }&#10;        return next;&#10;      });&#10;    },&#10;    [multiple],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ openItems, toggle }), [openItems, toggle]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;AccordionContext.Provider value={value}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/AccordionContext.Provider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function AccordionItem({ id, title, children }: { id: string; title: string; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const { openItems, toggle } = useContext(AccordionContext)!;&#10;  const isOpen = openItems.has(id);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; toggle(id)} aria-expanded={isOpen}&gt;&#10;        {title} {isOpen ? &#39;▾&#39; : &#39;▸&#39;}&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;      {isOpen &amp;&amp; &lt;div&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;Accordion.Item = AccordionItem;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface AccordionContextValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  openItems: Set&#x3C;string>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  toggle: (id: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const AccordionContext = createContext&#x3C;AccordionContextValue | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Accordion({ multiple = false, children }: { multiple?: boolean; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [openItems, setOpenItems] = useState&#x3C;Set&#x3C;string>>(new Set());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const toggle = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (id: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setOpenItems((prev) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const next = new Set(multiple ? prev : []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (next.has(id)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          next.delete(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          next.add(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [multiple],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ openItems, toggle }), [openItems, toggle]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AccordionContext.Provider value={value}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div>{children}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/AccordionContext.Provider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function AccordionItem({ id, title, children }: { id: string; title: string; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { openItems, toggle } = useContext(AccordionContext)!;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isOpen = openItems.has(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => toggle(id)} aria-expanded={isOpen}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {title} {isOpen ? '▾' : '▸'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {isOpen &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;div>{children}&#x3C;/div>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Accordion.Item = AccordionItem;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"灵活的-api-设计\">灵活的 API 设计</h2><p>复合组件相比 props 配置方式，提供了更灵活的 API：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Props 配置</th>\n<th>复合组件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自定义布局</td>\n<td>困难（固定结构）</td>\n<td>自由组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件渲染子项</td>\n<td>需要特殊 props</td>\n<td>直接使用 JSX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入额外内容</td>\n<td>需要 slot props</td>\n<td>直接在组件间插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>低（查看 props 文档）</td>\n<td>中（理解组件关系）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// Props 配置方式 - 灵活性低&#10;&lt;Tabs&#10;  items={[&#10;    { label: &#39;基础&#39;, content: &lt;BasicContent /&gt; },&#10;    { label: &#39;高级&#39;, content: &lt;AdvancedContent /&gt; },&#10;  ]}&#10;/&gt;&#10;&#10;// 复合组件方式 - 灵活性高&#10;&lt;Tabs defaultIndex={0}&gt;&#10;  &lt;div className=&quot;tab-header&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;Tabs.Tab index={0}&gt;基础&lt;/Tabs.Tab&gt;&#10;    &lt;Tabs.Tab index={1}&gt;高级&lt;/Tabs.Tab&gt;&#10;    &lt;span className=&quot;badge&quot;&gt;NEW&lt;/span&gt;  {/* 自由插入额外内容 */}&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;Tabs.TabPanel index={0}&gt;&#10;    &lt;BasicContent /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Tabs.TabPanel&gt;&#10;  {showAdvanced &amp;&amp; (  /* 条件渲染 */&#10;    &lt;Tabs.TabPanel index={1}&gt;&#10;      &lt;AdvancedContent /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Tabs.TabPanel&gt;&#10;  )}&#10;&lt;/Tabs&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Props 配置方式 - 灵活性低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Tabs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items={[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { label: '基础', content: &#x3C;BasicContent /> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { label: '高级', content: &#x3C;AdvancedContent /> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 复合组件方式 - 灵活性高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Tabs defaultIndex={0}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div className=\"tab-header\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Tabs.Tab index={0}>基础&#x3C;/Tabs.Tab></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Tabs.Tab index={1}>高级&#x3C;/Tabs.Tab></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;span className=\"badge\">NEW&#x3C;/span>  {/* 自由插入额外内容 */}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Tabs.TabPanel index={0}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;BasicContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Tabs.TabPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {showAdvanced &#x26;&#x26; (  /* 条件渲染 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Tabs.TabPanel index={1}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AdvancedContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Tabs.TabPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/Tabs></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 复合组件通过 Context 隐式共享状态，避免了 &quot;props drilling&quot;。但也要注意不要过度使用——对于简单的组件，直接的 props API 更直观。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"受控与非受控\">受控与非受控</h2><p>复合组件应同时支持受控和非受控模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Tabs({&#10;  activeIndex: controlledIndex,&#10;  defaultIndex = 0,&#10;  onChange,&#10;  children,&#10;}: {&#10;  activeIndex?: number;&#10;  defaultIndex?: number;&#10;  onChange?: (index: number) =&gt; void;&#10;  children: React.ReactNode;&#10;}) {&#10;  const [internalIndex, setInternalIndex] = useState(defaultIndex);&#10;  const isControlled = controlledIndex !== undefined;&#10;  const activeIndex = isControlled ? controlledIndex : internalIndex;&#10;&#10;  const setActiveIndex = useCallback(&#10;    (index: number) =&gt; {&#10;      if (!isControlled) {&#10;        setInternalIndex(index);&#10;      }&#10;      onChange?.(index);&#10;    },&#10;    [isControlled, onChange],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ activeIndex, setActiveIndex }), [activeIndex, setActiveIndex]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;TabsContext.Provider value={value}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/TabsContext.Provider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Tabs({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  activeIndex: controlledIndex,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  defaultIndex = 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onChange,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  activeIndex?: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  defaultIndex?: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onChange?: (index: number) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [internalIndex, setInternalIndex] = useState(defaultIndex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isControlled = controlledIndex !== undefined;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const activeIndex = isControlled ? controlledIndex : internalIndex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const setActiveIndex = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (index: number) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (!isControlled) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setInternalIndex(index);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onChange?.(index);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [isControlled, onChange],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ activeIndex, setActiveIndex }), [activeIndex, setActiveIndex]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;TabsContext.Provider value={value}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div>{children}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/TabsContext.Provider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>复合组件</strong> 通过 Context 隐式共享状态，子组件自由组合构成灵活的 API</li>\n<li>适用于 Tabs、Accordion、Menu、Select 等需要多个相关组件协作的场景</li>\n<li>相比 Props 配置方式，复合组件支持自定义布局、条件渲染、插入额外内容</li>\n<li>应同时支持<strong>受控和非受控</strong>模式，提高组件的通用性</li>\n<li>通过在 Context 创建时添加 <code>null</code> 检查和错误提示，帮助使用者正确使用组件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复合组件","id":"复合组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是复合组件","id":"什么是复合组件"},{"level":2,"text":"基础实现：Tabs 组件","id":"基础实现-tabs-组件"},{"level":3,"text":"使用方式","id":"使用方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Accordion 模式","id":"accordion-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"灵活的 API 设计","id":"灵活的-api-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"受控与非受控","id":"受控与非受控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Jotai 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/jotai-and-signals"},"next":{"title":"Render Props 与 HOC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/render-props-and-hoc"}}